<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Lock (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Conjurer (guild level 14), Sorcerer (guild level 16), Thief (guild level 40)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast lock &lt;door&gt;
cast lock &lt;direction&gt; &lt;door&gt;
cast lock &lt;container&gt;
</pre>
<p>Locks a closed door or container by magic, without a key: *cluck*. A door is 
locked from both sides at once. It must be closed first (see <a cmd='#'>Help Close</a>), 
and it must be something that can be locked at all.
</p><p>For opening a lock by magic, see <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Unlock</a>. For locking with a key, 
see <a cmd='#'>Help Lock</a>. You must be standing. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Unlock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Close</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>